<title>RUSSIA: Russia sets 33.33 pct coupon on 18-month OFZ bond.</title>
<headline>Russia sets 33.33 pct coupon on 18-month OFZ bond.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-01-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian finance ministry will pay quarterly interest of 83,097 roubles per bond on April 9 on the 18-month OFZ government bond maturing July 9, the central bank said on Sunday.</p>
<p>The interest is equivalent to an annual rate of 33.33 percent.</p>
<p>    Coupon date  Coupon number  Interest volume  Annual rate</p>
<p>    Jan 8	  4		  137,173 roubles  55.02 pct</p>
<p>    April 9	5		   83,097 roubles  33.33 pct</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
